{"assertionId":"e935fe67-8aa2-4171-bb5f-1ecf375f3384","entityBindings":[],"fragments":[{"exactText":"The OMICmAge™ algorithm is a multi-omic–informed methylation clock that quantifies biological age against chronological age.","fragmentId":"sha256:764fa99b84c7d3e70c2cda338e8312a025f5eb0cf0362c61cdcca5157ba1c616"}],"proposition":"The page defines OMICmAge as a direct measurement of chronological age from a saliva glucose test.","qualifiers":[],"rubricVersion":"evidence-only.v1"}